[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=52 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="听证室临时借了一间旧仓房。桌子拼得不齐，中间两条缝各塞着一片木头。窗外有人叫卖修好的水桶，门里的人说话时，不得不偶尔停下来等吆喝过去。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="sanfrancisco"

speaker_name=""

text="今天先核查材料和保管办法。需要问人的，会另行通知。别把站在这里的人直接当成结论，也别拿“还在核查”当成什么都不用交代。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你把原件放在靠里的一侧，两个副本分别放在桌两边。帕金斯念页码，另一名值班员跟着翻。翻到潮痕的证词时，桌旁有人伸手想拿去看，被她先按住封口。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="人员材料单独登记。不是不给你，是要知道你拿去哪儿、什么时候还。你想看哪一部分，我把对应的编号写给你。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="港口代表"

speaker_name=""

text="大家都在传，门里存着失踪的人。你们带回来一箱东西，还要按编号排队看，外面会觉得你们又在藏。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="那就先把能确认的目录贴出来。哪些带回来了，哪些没找到，哪些涉及名字，为什么暂不公开，都写在同一张上，别只写“另行通知”。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="对面的人问目录上能不能印负责人的名字。旧金山没有接着替你回答，而是把笔推到你手边。你写下现在使用的称呼，又在后面加上所属小队。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我不知道自己原来的名字。这个称呼在港口查得到我。需要问我经手的部分，可以来找我；看不懂的地方，我不会因为签了字就装作知道。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="港口代表"

speaker_name=""

text="那如果有人说，这些东西只认得你，你一走，我们仍然什么都打不开呢？你们能保证以后不用再等你回来吗？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="可以先验证现在能读的部分。这里的纸、设备编号和抄录都不需要他。加密内容仍然封着，我们没有把“能打开”写进已经完成的事里。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="拉姆森把一台独立读取器放到桌上，接好电池。她特地换了另一根线，叫那名代表自己按开关。屏幕亮起时，显示的不是头像，而是一行有缺字的维修记录。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="这就是你现在能查的。缺的字我们没有补，也没有藏在下一页。原页的照片在旁边，你可以一边看，一边找我们有没有抄错。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="屋里的人围过来了一点。有人先问这能不能证明自己的妹妹还在，问题刚出口，后面的人就跟着报了另一个名字。德雷顿把空椅子挪开，给门口留出能进出的路。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="一个一个问。我们不能从这一页答出每个人的去向，但会把你们想查的人记下来。别把联系方式留在外面的公告上，去旁边这张表。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="名单上出现一个名字，不等于人还在。没有名字，也不能直接算不在。这两句得先讲，否则不管谁先看到，都会替另一半猜下去。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="说话的人听见这句，低头捏着手里的布帽，没有马上接表。你没再催他，只把笔放在他够得着的地方。过了一会儿，他问如果以前名字登记错了，能不能把小名也写上。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="能。认识的字不会写，也可以说给记录员听。记忆里不确定的地方就标出来，不用今天一次讲完整。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="潮痕站起来，报出自己曾经使用的值班编号。先前那名代表看了看她，又看向旧金山，问这是不是事先安排好的一出道歉。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_18"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="tideborn"

speaker_name=""

text="不是。我暂扣过一份申请，这里是我写的经过。它不够回答别人的事。你们可以查我的记录，也可以以后再叫我来，不需要因为我现在说了，就到这里为止。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_19"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="sanfrancisco"

speaker_name=""

text="她的证词由两个不同班次的人分别收。涉及她原来的工作关系，我不担任唯一的核查人。保管钥匙也分开，不由同一个办公室一直拿着。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_20"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="这次有人提出反对，说分得太开会拖慢办事，旧金山请他把会慢在哪里讲清楚。对方指着两间值班室，说夜里跑两趟，要经过那段还没修好的浮桥。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_21"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="那就先不让材料跟着人过桥。副本留在两边，借阅也在各自值班室办；需要对原件的时候再约时间。桥没修好，不能当作只留一把钥匙的理由。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_22"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="副本核对后盖不同的章，保留各自的修订。要是两份不一样，暂停引用那一页，不是把错的一份偷偷换掉。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_23"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="一名一直没说话的老记录员抬头，问谁负责补上漏掉的页码。你指出箱里的两张索引，她看完以后，摇了摇头，把其中一张翻到背面。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_24"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="记录员"

speaker_name=""

text="这不是缺页，是下一册的领用签。后面还有一份接收单，收件地点写着北面的干船坞。你们去过那儿吗？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_25"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="没有。我们看到的是灯塔和主档案，不包括那座船坞。它现在还能不能靠船，也没有确认过。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_26"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="旧金山把那张纸单独放好，没有宣布新的任务。她先让记录员把为什么认出领用签写下来，又让人去查北侧航标最近一次维护的时间。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_27"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="sanfrancisco"

speaker_name=""

text="这条线记到待核查。明天先看靠泊条件，不安排今天刚回来的小队立刻出海。想知道后面还有什么，也得先让人把今天交完。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_28"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="窗外的叫卖换成了送水车的铃声。听证还没有结束，桌上的问题也没变少。你收起那支写得只剩一点的铅笔，发现帕金斯已经替你留好了另一支。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_29"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我还有一件要补。第三处码头有人留守，收信时段已经改了。别在公告上写旧的，不然今晚又会有人站在没有回应的频道里等。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_30"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="值班员低头改字，旧金山把那一栏转向门口，让还没走的人看清。帕金斯接着核对最后几页的封口，你帮她按住容易翘起的那一边，等确认无误，才放下手走出仓房。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_31"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="门外还站着一个抱布帽的人。你认出他刚才问过妹妹的名字，以为他忘了带表，正要回去拿，他却摇摇头，从内袋里取出半张照片。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_32"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="港口居民"

speaker_name=""

text="名字我已经写了。这个能不能也交？背面有她以前写的地址，旧地方已经在水下，我不知道留着还有没有用。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_33"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="交副本可以吗？原件你带回去。我们现在有能翻拍的设备，拍的时候你也在旁边，确定没漏掉背面的字，再拿去登记。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_34"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="照片上的人没有正看镜头，像刚听见有人叫她。那人伸手挡住外面飘进来的雨，迟疑很久，才把一直压在照片边缘的手指移开一点。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_35"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="港口居民"

speaker_name=""

text="以前拿出去打听，有人把照片直接留下了，说过几天还我。后来换了值班，我去问，谁都不知道是谁拿的。这张是最后一张。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "perkins", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_36"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="那这次不留。你跟我进去，先拍，再一起看清楚。我把接收人的名字写给你，你也看看是不是读得出来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "drayton", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_37"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你让开门口，给他们撑了一会儿伞。旧金山从仓房出来，问你今晚住哪里。你说还是第五小队那边，她又问，你自己是不是愿意继续住。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "drayton", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_38"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="愿意。不过临时登记的期限快到了。门房昨天提醒我，要是要续住得提前说，不能等牌子摘下来再找人。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "drayton", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_39"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="sanfrancisco"

speaker_name=""

text="我知道。新的申请今天已经送过去，但有一项得由你自己填。担保人那栏有我和弗莱彻，不是让你照我们想的方式写。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "drayton", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_40"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她递给你一张没有封口的纸。上面问离港以后是否需要保留联络地址，还有谁能代收通知。你以前以为这种问题只有能证明身份的人才有资格回答。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "drayton", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_41"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="通知先交给我。要是我不在，让第五小队转交。别因为我现在说不出过去住过哪儿，就把每一封信都先送到担保人那里。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "drayton", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_42"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="sanfrancisco"

speaker_name=""

text="可以。这一条我会一起交。还有，你们带回的记录可能会让港口起很大的争论。我会出面处理，但不向你保证大家很快就能互相理解。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "drayton", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_43"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我也没法保证自己一直知道该怎么答。今天有人问失踪的人是不是还在，我差一点只想让他先安心，后来才把那句话咽回去。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "drayton", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_44"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="旧金山低头收好纸，说她也有过没咽回去的时候。她没有讲是谁，门里的记录员正叫她核签，她应了一声，便回去了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "drayton", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_45"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="你填好了就一起走。回程不用看海图，跟着我就行。不是考你还记不记得路，今天已经够长了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_46"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你把半张没写完的联络单收进内袋，雨水没有碰到它。走过告示栏时，你看见有人在新目录下面添了一行小字，问北侧干船坞的值班员还能不能找到。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_47"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="明早我想先来看看这张纸。要是有人答了，记下他是谁，再去找你们。今晚先不追过去，饭盒还没还全，衣服也还晾着。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "drayton", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_48"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="弗莱彻说好，把伞往你这边挪了一点。潮声从仓房后面传来，和第一天醒来时一样近。你仍然想知道以前的自己是谁，却也开始担心明天起风，会不会把没收好的那件外套又吹进水里。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

